    "description": "Quiza Cenitana was a place located on the coast of Mauretania Caesariensis. Various ancient authors refer to it by different terms - colonia (Ptolemy), municipium (Antonine Itinerary), and oppidum (Pliny the Elder).",
    "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: el Bénian</p>",
